{"product_id":"riot-squad-salts-watermelon-ice","title":"Riot Squad Salts - Watermelon Ice","description":"\u003cp style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRiot Squad are taking sweet slices of juicy watermelon and freezing them over with a chilled blast of menthol for the ultimate fruity vape refreshment!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNic Salts are extracted directly from the natural tobacco leaf versus traditionally being made using a form of artificial nicotine called 'free base'. This range from Riot Squad is a hybrid version, using 50% freebase nicotine and 50% salt nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand Name: Riot Squad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50%\/50%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30 ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20MG \u0026amp; 48MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Riot Squad","offers":[{"title":"20mg","offer_id":41670481674295,"sku":"69d25e58664a5","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"48mg","offer_id":41670481707063,"sku":"69d25e59037d3","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/riot-salt-watermelon-ice-vape-juice.jpg?v=1747700463","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/riot-squad-salts-watermelon-ice","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




